The shared executor for Patterns and Playout commands, used by the desk and the rig:
- local refusals, tickets, one journal row per command at completion, observation in STATE ('seen' / 'not seen');
- the cue planner (load, start, end of turn; opt-in standby with the idle guard; Patterns CUE GO only);
- timed GO (AT by offset, untimed members held to T − rtt/2, the all-untimed fallback, 'scheduled for' / 'started late' rows);
- next-on-end at most once per item execution, and only from the VT link;
- the AI re-target helper.
